  {
    "title": "ARCS: name variants across the 1891 and 1896 rolls",
    "create_time": 1719086400.0,
    "update_time": 1719090200.0,
    "mapping": {
      "root-arcs-0002-namelist": {
        "id": "root-arcs-0002-namelist",
        "message": null,
        "parent": null,
        "children": [
          "arcs-0002-namelist-n01"
        ]
      },
      "arcs-0002-namelist-n01": {
        "id": "arcs-0002-namelist-n01",
        "message": {
          "id": "arcs-0002-namelist-n01",
          "author": {
            "role": "user",
            "name": null,
            "metadata": {}
          },
          "create_time": 1719086447.0,
          "update_time": null,
          "content": {
            "content_type": "text",
            "parts": [
              "In the 1891 roll the name is written 'Te Rangi Whakaara'. In the 1896 roll the same holding number 214 is written 'Rangiwhakaara'. Are these the same person?"
            ]
          },
          "status": "finished_successfully",
          "end_turn": false,
          "weight": 1.0,
          "metadata": {},
          "recipient": "all"
        },
        "parent": "root-arcs-0002-namelist",
        "children": [
          "arcs-0002-namelist-n02"
        ]
      },
      "arcs-0002-namelist-n02": {
        "id": "arcs-0002-namelist-n02",
        "message": {
          "id": "arcs-0002-namelist-n02",
          "author": {
            "role": "assistant",
            "name": null,
            "metadata": {}
          },
          "create_time": 1719086494.0,
          "update_time": null,
          "content": {
            "content_type": "text",
            "parts": [
              "The holding number is the strongest link: 214 appearing in both rolls against a name that differs only by the honorific 'Te' and by word division is consistent with one person recorded by two clerks. Word division in Māori names was not standardised in nineteenth-century rolls. Treat it as the same person with moderate confidence, and look for a third source — a burial record or a succession order — before treating it as settled."
            ]
          },
          "status": "finished_successfully",
          "end_turn": true,
          "weight": 1.0,
          "metadata": {
            "model_slug": "gpt-4o"
          },
          "recipient": "all"
        },
        "parent": "arcs-0002-namelist-n01",
        "children": [
          "arcs-0002-namelist-n03"
        ]
      },
      "arcs-0002-namelist-n03": {
        "id": "arcs-0002-namelist-n03",
        "message": {
          "id": "arcs-0002-namelist-n03",
          "author": {
            "role": "user",
            "name": null,
            "metadata": {}
          },
          "create_time": 1719086541.0,
          "update_time": null,
          "content": {
            "content_type": "text",
            "parts": [
              "There is a succession order dated 3 August 1898 naming 'Rangi Whakaara of Kaiora' as successor to holding 214."
            ]
          },
          "status": "finished_successfully",
          "end_turn": false,
          "weight": 1.0,
          "metadata": {},
          "recipient": "all"
        },
        "parent": "arcs-0002-namelist-n02",
        "children": [
          "arcs-0002-namelist-n04"
        ]
      },
      "arcs-0002-namelist-n04": {
        "id": "arcs-0002-namelist-n04",
        "message": {
          "id": "arcs-0002-namelist-n04",
          "author": {
            "role": "assistant",
            "name": null,
            "metadata": {}
          },
          "create_time": 1719086588.0,
          "update_time": null,
          "content": {
            "content_type": "text",
            "parts": [
              "That closes it. A succession order is a court record tying a named individual to a specific holding, so holding 214 links 'Te Rangi Whakaara' (1891), 'Rangiwhakaara' (1896) and 'Rangi Whakaara of Kaiora' (1898). The 1898 order also gives you a terminus: the original holder had died by 3 August 1898."
            ]
          },
          "status": "finished_successfully",
          "end_turn": true,
          "weight": 1.0,
          "metadata": {
            "model_slug": "gpt-4o"
          },
          "recipient": "all"
        },
        "parent": "arcs-0002-namelist-n03",
        "children": [
          "arcs-0002-namelist-n05"
        ]
      },
      "arcs-0002-namelist-n05": {
        "id": "arcs-0002-namelist-n05",
        "message": {
          "id": "arcs-0002-namelist-n05",
          "author": {
            "role": "user",
            "name": null,
            "metadata": {}
          },
          "create_time": 1719090060.0,
          "update_time": null,
          "content": {
            "content_type": "text",
            "parts": [
              "Found the burial record: 'Rangi Whakaara, Kaiora, died 11 July 1898, aged 63.' Does that change anything?"
            ]
          },
          "status": "finished_successfully",
          "end_turn": false,
          "weight": 1.0,
          "metadata": {},
          "recipient": "all"
        },
        "parent": "arcs-0002-namelist-n04",
        "children": [
          "arcs-0002-namelist-n06"
        ]
      },
      "arcs-0002-namelist-n06": {
        "id": "arcs-0002-namelist-n06",
        "message": {
          "id": "arcs-0002-namelist-n06",
          "author": {
            "role": "assistant",
            "name": null,
            "metadata": {}
          },
          "create_time": 1719090120.0,
          "update_time": null,
          "content": {
            "content_type": "text",
            "parts": [
              "It fixes the death date at 11 July 1898, three weeks before the succession order of 3 August 1898, and gives a birth year of about 1835. The 1891 and 1896 roll entries therefore both fall within this person's lifetime, which removes the last reason to doubt that they are one individual."
            ]
          },
          "status": "finished_successfully",
          "end_turn": true,
          "weight": 1.0,
          "metadata": {
            "model_slug": "gpt-4o"
          },
          "recipient": "all"
        },
        "parent": "arcs-0002-namelist-n05",
        "children": []
      }
    },
