  {
    "title": "ARCS: wāhi tapu locations — handle with care",
    "create_time": 1719345600.0,
    "update_time": 1719345694.0,
    "mapping": {
      "root-arcs-0005-restricted": {
        "id": "root-arcs-0005-restricted",
        "message": null,
        "parent": null,
        "children": [
          "arcs-0005-restricted-n01"
        ]
      },
      "arcs-0005-restricted-n01": {
        "id": "arcs-0005-restricted-n01",
        "message": {
          "id": "arcs-0005-restricted-n01",
          "author": {
            "role": "user",
            "name": null,
            "metadata": {}
          },
          "create_time": 1719345647.0,
          "update_time": null,
          "content": {
            "content_type": "text",
            "parts": [
              "I have been given the location of an urupā near the Kaiora estuary by a kaumātua, on the understanding that it is not published. How should the archive hold it?"
            ]
          },
          "status": "finished_successfully",
          "end_turn": false,
          "weight": 1.0,
          "metadata": {},
          "recipient": "all"
        },
        "parent": "root-arcs-0005-restricted",
        "children": [
          "arcs-0005-restricted-n02"
        ]
      },
      "arcs-0005-restricted-n02": {
        "id": "arcs-0005-restricted-n02",
        "message": {
          "id": "arcs-0005-restricted-n02",
          "author": {
            "role": "assistant",
            "name": null,
            "metadata": {}
          },
          "create_time": 1719345694.0,
          "update_time": null,
          "content": {
            "content_type": "text",
            "parts": [
              "Hold it under your most restricted class and make the restriction a property of the record rather than a note in it, so that any export path has to check the class before it can emit the record. Store the fact that a location was given, the date, and who granted it, separately from the coordinates themselves; that way you can cite the provenance of the knowledge without disclosing the place. An export that cannot express the restriction should refuse to run rather than emit a redacted version that looks complete."
            ]
          },
          "status": "finished_successfully",
          "end_turn": true,
          "weight": 1.0,
          "metadata": {
            "model_slug": "gpt-4o"
          },
          "recipient": "all"
        },
        "parent": "arcs-0005-restricted-n01",
        "children": []
      }
    },
